#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable All Thresholds"
msgstr "Zima Vizingiti Vyote"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Alerting on all Thresholds.  This can be used when it is necessary to perform maintenance on your network."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutazima Tahadhari kwenye Vizingiti vyote.  Hii inaweza kutumika inapokuwa lazima kufanya matengenezo kwenye mtandao wako."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Auto Create Thresholds"
msgstr "Unda Vizingiti Kiotomatiki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If selected, when running either automation, or when creating/saving a Device, all Thresholds associated with the Device Template will be created."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, unapoendesha uotomatishaji, au unapounda/unapohifadhi Kifaa, Vizingiti vyote vinavyohusiana na Kiolezo cha Kifaa vitaundwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Chukulia Data Isiyojulikana kama Sifuri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When checking Thresholds, if a Data Source returns Unknown Data ('U'), consider the value as zero for the Threshold check. You can also enable log this issue."
msgstr "Wakati wa kukagua Vizingiti, ikiwa Chanzo cha Data kinarejesha Data Isiyojulikana ('U'), chukulia thamani hiyo kuwa sifuri kwa ukaguzi wa Kizingiti. Unaweza pia kuwasha kumbukumbu kwa suala hili."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Management Status"
msgstr "Hali Chaguo-msingi ya Usimamizi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Threshold management filter status."
msgstr "Hali chaguo-msingi ya kichujio cha usimamizi wa Kizingiti."

