msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Imewashwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Thamani Chaguomsingi ya ifHighSpeed Tupu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Wakati wa kukokotoa Vizingiti vya Mlinganyo, ikiwa ifHighSpeed na ifSpeed zinarudi zikiwa sifuri, tumia mpangilio ufuatao wa ifHighSpeed badala yake. Chaguo-msingi la ifHighSpeed litakuwa 10000 kwa violesura vya 10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Mapendeleo ya Arifa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Zima Arifa za Zamani"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutazima Tahadhari za Zamani kwenye Vizingiti vyote.  Tahadhari za Zamani zinafafanuliwa kama Tahadhari Maalum za Barua Pepe zozote ambazo hazijahusishwa na Orodha ya Arifa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Taarifa ya Kizingiti Imewekwa Kiolezo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, unapounda Kiolezo cha Kizingiti, Mipangilio yake ya Arifa itamilikiwa kwa chaguo-msingi na Kiolezo cha Kizingiti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Washa Utekelezaji wa Amri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutawasha uwezo wa kuendesha amri kwenye matukio ya ukiukaji wa Kizingiti na kurejesha hali."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Washa Arifa kwa Kila Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutawasha uwezo wa kutunza maudhui maalum ya Barua Pepe kwa ajili ya Vizingiti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Washa Foleni ya Arifa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutabadilisha Thold kutoka kutekeleza Arifa za moja kwa moja hadi kutumia aidha Notification Daemon, au arifa zinazotekelezwa nje ya mkondo na kikusanyaji cha Arifa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Washa Utumaji wa Barua Pepe za Tahadhari kwa Orodha za Arifa za Onyo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ikiwa ungependa wapokeaji wa Orodha ya Arifa za Onyo wapokee Barua Pepe za Tahadhari pamoja na wapokeaji wa orodha ya Arifa za Tahadhari.  Hali hii inatumika wakati Arifa za Onyo zinapoenda kwa Wasimamizi na Arifa za Tahadhari zinapoenda kwa Uongozi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon ya Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Washa Huduma ya Nyuma ya Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutawasha matumizi ya Threshold daemon maalum. Hii inaweza kutumika kuongeza utendakazi wa mfumo na/au kusambaza ufuatiliaji wa Kizingiti kwenye seva tofauti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Lazimisha Utatuzi wa Daemon ya Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Kutiki kisanduku hiki kutawasha utatuzi wa Threshold Daemon inapofanya kazi kutoka SystemD au kupitia mstari wa amri.  Badiliko hili ni badiliko la moja kwa moja na litaanza kutumika mara tu mzunguko unaofuata wa Kizingiti utakapoanza."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Marudio ya Arifa ya Kuzimika kwa Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Ikiwa Thold Daemon ikipatikana haifanyi kazi, tuma arifa ya Barua Pepe kwa marudio haya."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Kila Saa %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Nyuzi za Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Idadi ya nyuzi za daemoni zitakazoshughulikiwa na Daemoni ya Kizingiti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Mchakato 1"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "Michakato %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Kuweka Kumbukumbu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Weka Kumbukumbu ya Ukiukaji wa Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Washa uwekaji kumbukumbu wa hitilafu zote za Kizingiti kwenye Kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Onyesha Chanzo cha Data kwenye Kumbukumbu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Onyesha jina la Chanzo cha Data kwenye Kumbukumbu ikiwa halipo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Weka Kumbukumbu ya Mabadiliko ya Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Washa uwekaji kumbukumbu wa mabadiliko yote ya Kizingiti kwenye Kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Utatuzi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Washa uwekaji kumbukumbu wa ujumbe wa utatuzi pamoja na Kizingiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Kumbukumbu za Tahadhari"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Tunza Kumbukumbu za Kizingiti kwa idadi hii ya siku."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Rekodi hatua ya Kuchukulia Data Isiyojulikana kama Sifuri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Wakati 'Chukulia Data Isiyojulikana kama Sifuri' imewashwa, weka kumbukumbu inapotokea"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog Imewashwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, unapounda Kizingiti kipya, kwa chaguo-msingi matukio mapya ya Kizingiti yatatumwa kwa syslog yako ya ndani. Mpangilio huu ni mpangilio awali. Mipangilio ya Kizingiti huamua udhibiti halisi wa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Kipaumbele/Kiwango Chaguo-msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Hiki ni Kipaumbele/Kiwango chaguomsingi ambacho Thold itatumia kutuma ujumbe wa Syslog.  Mpangilio huu ni mpangilio wa awali.  Mipangilio ya Kizingiti huamua udhibiti halisi wa Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Kitengo Chaguo-msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Hiki ni Kituo chaguomsingi ambacho Thold itatumia kutuma ujumbe wa Syslog.  Mpangilio huu ni mpangilio wa awali.  Mipangilio ya Kizingiti huamua udhibiti halisi wa Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Mipangilio Awali ya Tahadhari"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Misamaha ya wikendi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Ikiwa hii imeteuliwa, Thold haitafanya kazi wikendi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Idadi Chaguo-msingi ya Vichochezi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya mara mfululizo ambazo Chanzo cha Data lazima kivuke Kizingiti ili Tahadhari itolewe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Kuarifu Upya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Rudia Tahadhari baada ya idadi iliyobainishwa ya mizunguko ya kikusanyaji."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Mipangilio Awali ya Mstari wa Msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Masafa Chaguomsingi ya Muda wa Mstari wa Msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Hii ni thamani chaguomsingi inayotumika katika kuunda Vizingiti au violezo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Idadi ya Vichocheo vya Mstari wa Msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Idadi chaguo-msingi ya mara mfululizo ambazo Chanzo cha Data lazima kivuke Kizingiti cha Msingi kilichokokotolewa ili Tahadhari itolewe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Asilimia ya Mkengeuko wa Mstari wa Msingi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Arifa ya SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Arifa za SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Ujumbe wa hali ya kizingiti (taarifa/mitego) utatumwa kwa wapokeaji wa arifa za SNMP. Hii inajumuisha Tahadhari, Maonyo na mitego ya Urejeshaji kwa chaguo-msingi. Kumbuka: Kipengele hiki kinahitaji programu-jalizi ya Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Zima Arifa za Onyo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Ikiwa hii imeteuliwa, Kizingiti hakitatuma arifa wakati Kizingiti cha onyo kimevukwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Zima Arifa za Urejeshaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Ikiwa hii imeteuliwa, Kizingiti hakitatuma arifa wakati Kizingiti kimerudi kwenye hali ya kawaida."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kutuma Barua Pepe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Tuma Barua Pepe zenye Kipaumbele cha Haraka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Hukuruhusu kuweka Barua Pepe zenye kipaumbele cha dharura"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Tuma Arifa kama Maandishi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, hii itasababisha Arifa zote kutumwa kama Barua Pepe za maandishi wazi bila grafu. Chaguo-msingi ni Barua Pepe za HTML zenye grafu iliyopachikwa ndani ya Barua Pepe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Tuma Barua Pepe kando kwa kila anwani"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, hii itasababisha Barua Pepe zote kutumwa kando kwa kila anwani."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Anwani ya Barua Pepe ya Mtumaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Hii ni anwani ya Barua Pepe ambayo Kizingiti kitaonekana kimetoka kwake."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Jina la Mtumaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Hili ndilo jina halisi ambalo Kizingiti kitaonekana kimetoka kwake."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Arifa ya Kifaa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Washa Arifa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Washa arifa ya kipangishi Kilichokufa/Kinachopona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Arifa ya Barua Pepe Moja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Inaauniwa kwa Orodha za Arifa na Foleni ya Arifa pekee.  Ikiwa kuna Arifa za Kifaa Kilichozimika katika mzunguko mmoja wa uchakataji.  Tuma Barua Pepe moja pekee kwa wapokeaji wa Orodha ya Arifa kwa Vifaa vyote."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Mada ya Arifa ya Barua Pepe Moja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr "Hili ni Somo la Barua Pepe litakalotumika kwa Barua Pepe zote za Arifa ya Barua Pepe Moja kwa Vifaa Vinavyofanya Kazi na Visivyofanya Kazi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Delay Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Ucheleweshaji wa Arifa ya Kifaa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Delay"
msgstr "Ucheleweshaji wa Arifa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If a large influx of Down Device Notifications come in, Cacti can pause sending out those Notifications for a certain period of time to see if the issue is transient before sending them out.  Select the threshold Down Device Notifications before the Pause is Triggered."
msgstr "Ikiwa mtiririko mkubwa wa Arifa za Kifaa Kilichozima utaingia, Cacti inaweza kusitisha kutuma Arifa hizo kwa muda fulani ili kuona kama tatizo ni la muda kabla ya kuzituma.  Chagua kizingiti cha Arifa za Kifaa Kilichozima kabla ya Kusitishwa Kuanzishwa."

