#: thold_templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br>Math Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "Msemo wa RPN ni Msemo wa RPN unaolingana na RRDtool.  Sintaksia inajumuisha vitendakazi vyote vilivyo hapa chini pamoja na misemo ya ubadilishaji ya Kifaa na Hoji ya Data kama vile <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  Ili kutumia Chanzo cha Data katika Msemo wa RPN, ni lazima utumie sintaksia: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  Kwa mfano, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> itapata thamani ya sasa ya Chanzo cha Data cha traffic_in kwa RRDfile(s) zinazohusiana na Grafu. Chanzo chochote cha Data kwa ajili ya Grafu kinaweza kujumuishwa.<br>Waendeshaji wa Hisabati: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Vitendakazi: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Waendeshaji wa Mtiririko: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Vitendakazi vya Ulinganisho: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

